respect lowercase:

absolute accuracy: player's attack doesn't miss
celestial gift: summons the Spear of Longinus to be used in combat
counter: if player doesn't take damage from enemy's previous attack, player's next attack deals
30 more damage points
divine intervention: when player is at less than 20% health, Kaworu appears and prevents the player
from taking damage for one round
double or nothing: player's attack does either double damage or does no damage
eek! run!: player can't attack for one round but the next 2 rounds, the enemy attacks become easier
to evade
healing mist: player can opt not to attack to regenerate health
miracle sync: when player is at 10% sync rate or less, a special attack is unlocked and player's
sync rate increases
overclock: attack increases by 75% but AT field gets set to 0 and player takes 40 damage points
ruthless: when enemy is at 10% health or less, attack gets raised significantly

